## Install and run
$ adb install -r app-debug.apk
Success

## Drive every screen (uiautomator finds the controls by their test tags)
$ adb shell am force-stop dev.undra.playground && adb logcat -c
$ adb shell am start -n dev.undra.playground/.MainActivity --es tab todos
Starting: Intent { cmp=dev.undra.playground/.MainActivity (has extras) }
$ adb shell pidof dev.undra.playground
6238

## Todos: add (typed TodoError.EmptyTitle), toggle, remaining
$ ui tap todo-add
